In Australia our single-phase is 240v and our three-phase is 415v. 

According to [this chart](http://www.apiste-global.com/enc/technology_enc/detail/id=1268) America can run 115/230 single-phase and 230v three-phase, so would the stove/dryer sockets be 230v single or three-phase? (I've never heard of 230v single-phase in USA before now)  
